{"id":"38ce4e4a0ae6371c","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Separative Quotient","display":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing Separative Quotient","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing Separative Quotient","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing Separative Quotient"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\((\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (forcing poset, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\((Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span>（待构造的商偏序）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>（可分预序）与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>（其对称核）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativeQuotient}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativeQuotient}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}preorder} \\vdash p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}r\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}preorder} \\vdash p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}r\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash p\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\land q\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash p\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\land q\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativeQuotient}_S(Q,\\leq_Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land Q=\\{[p]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}}:p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\\leq_Q=\\{\\langle[p]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}},[q]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}}\\rangle:p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativeQuotient}_S(Q,\\leq_Q,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land Q=\\{[p]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}}:p\\in\\mathbb P\\}\\land\\leq_Q=\\{\\langle[p]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}},[q]_{\\equiv_{\\mathbb P}}\\rangle:p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land p\\preccurlyeq^*_{\\mathbb P}q\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\preccurlyeq^*q\">\\(p\\preccurlyeq^*q\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的每个加强都与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 相容；对称核给出可分等价关系，商序由该预序诱导。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depend